        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Regular participles: **-ar → -ado**, **-er / -ir → -ido**. The participle never changes."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Use it after triggers of the subjunctive (**espero que, no creo que, es posible que, ojalá, cuando**...) when the action is **completed**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: it's the present perfect (**he hablado**) wearing subjunctive clothes (**haya hablado**)."
        }
      ]
